when alt tabbing in ubuntu i get a white border around the chosen window, can this be disabled?
   -> DONE (investigated, nothing changed on your box). It is OPENBOX's own focus-cycle indicator - not a compositor (none runs) and NOT the theme: none of openbox's 58 colour keys covers it, it is compiled in.
   -> Fix: copy /etc/xdg/openbox/rc.xml to ~/.config/openbox/rc.xml (you have no user copy) and add <bar>no</bar> inside the NextWindow AND PreviousWindow actions, then `openbox --reconfigure`. Full detail + fallback in work/VERIFY_NOW.md.

